  "details": "Loading doesn't take much more time than normal. However all UI related things are not loading. the attached images and imgur link goes into more detail however the sequence is as follows\nAfter 15 minutes or so the local players list will load. Possibly world icons\n30-45 minutes of waiting and parts of the social tab will load. Local players will load but icons may or may not load. World Icons will usually load but not all worlds\n1 hour-1.5 hours and almost everything will have loaded except the friends list and online/offline lists. When clicking on a world icon, it will show all users from that world in private instances. \nUsually by this point everything will finally load and I will be able to jump to a different world. However today 1/13/2018 the private instances never finished up and i was never able to load a new world after 5 hours. \nPortals are completely unusable. \nhttps://imgur.com/a/7MgXQ",
